@startuml
title Subscriptions — as-built read paths: list/filter/search, detail, ARPU/LTV report

actor Partner as U
participant "subscriptions screens\n(list / detail)" as Screen
participant "SubscriptionHandler\n(subscription.go)" as H
participant "SubscriptionRepo\n(FindWithFilters — DB-side)" as Repo
database "subscriptions / transactions /\nsubscription_event / snapshot" as DB

== List / filter / search (DB-side) ==
U -> Screen : open list, apply filters/search/sort, page
Screen -> H : GET /apps/{appID}/subscriptions?page&pageSize&status&subscription_status&plan&priceMin/Max&billingInterval&search&sortBy&sortOrder
H -> Repo : FindWithFilters(dynamic WHERE + LIKE + LIMIT/OFFSET)
Repo -> DB : single paginated query (deleted_at IS NULL)
Repo -> DB : batch FindByDomains (shop logos/names — N+1 mitigated)
Repo --> H : rows + total
H --> Screen : {subscriptions, total, page, pageSize, totalPages}
Screen -> H : GET /subscriptions/summary -> KPI cards (active/at-risk/churned/avg)

== Detail ==
U -> Screen : open a subscription
Screen -> H : GET /subscriptions/{id}  (+ /history, /risk-timeline)
H -> DB : detail + last ~12mo payments + subscription_event transitions
note right of H : MRRCents = annual? BasePrice/12 (FLOOR) : BasePrice\nStartDate = ActivatedAt else CreatedAt (business start)
H --> Screen : billing + status + payment history + risk timeline

== ARPU / LTV report ==
U -> Screen : open Subscriptions report
Screen -> H : GET /apps/{appID}/reports/subscriptions[?format=csv]
H -> DB : all subs (FindByAppID) + latest snapshot (churn denom)
H -> H : ARPU = Σ MRR(SAFE) / count(SAFE) [floor]\nchurn = churned / snapshot.total (90d window)\nLTV = ARPU / churn [round; 0 if churn=0 -> UI "—"]\nper-plan LTV uses APP-level churn (approx, D1)
H --> Screen : {activeSubs, activeMrrCents, arpuCents, ltvCents, churnRate, plans[]}

note over H,DB
  DIVERGENCES: per-plan LTV uses app-level churn (D1) ; annual MRR floor vs
  frontend round (D2, 1c) ; churn window 90d here vs 30d in Churn report (D3) ;
  report collapses to one currency (D4) ; systemic org-check on resolveAppFromRequest (D5)
end note
@enduml
